       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ANAGRAM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-SUBJECT PIC X(20).
       01 WS-CANDIDATES-COUNT PIC 9.
       01 WS-CANDIDATES-TABLE.
           02 WS-CANDIDATES OCCURS 1 TO 20
                            DEPENDING ON WS-CANDIDATES-COUNT.
              05 WS-CANDIDATE PIC X(20).
       01 WS-RESULT-LIST PIC X(48).

       LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CANDIDATE-IND PIC 9.
       01 CANDIDATE PIC X(20).
       01 CHAR-IND PIC 9(2).
       01 CHAR-COUNT PIC 9(2).
       01 RESULT-POINTER PIC 9(2).

       01 SUBJECT-CHAR-COUNTS.
           05 SUBJECT-CHAR-COUNT OCCURS 26 TIMES PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       FIND-ANAGRAMS.

       MOVE 1 TO RESULT-POINTER
       MOVE "" TO WS-RESULT-LIST

       MOVE FUNCTION LOWER-CASE(WS-SUBJECT) TO WS-SUBJECT

       PERFORM VARYING CHAR-IND FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL CHAR-IND > 26
           MOVE 0 TO SUBJECT-CHAR-COUNT(CHAR-IND)
           INSPECT WS-SUBJECT TALLYING SUBJECT-CHAR-COUNT(CHAR-IND)
               FOR ALL FUNCTION CHAR(97 + CHAR-IND)
       END-PERFORM

       PERFORM VARYING CANDIDATE-IND FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL CANDIDATE-IND > WS-CANDIDATES-COUNT
           MOVE FUNCTION LOWER-CASE(WS-CANDIDATES(CANDIDATE-IND))
               TO CANDIDATE
           IF CANDIDATE = WS-SUBJECT
               EXIT PERFORM CYCLE
           END-IF

           PERFORM VARYING CHAR-IND FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL CHAR-IND >= 26
               MOVE 0 TO CHAR-COUNT
               INSPECT CANDIDATE TALLYING CHAR-COUNT
                   FOR ALL FUNCTION CHAR(97 + CHAR-IND)
               IF CHAR-COUNT <> SUBJECT-CHAR-COUNT(CHAR-IND)
                   EXIT PERFORM
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM

           IF CHAR-IND > 26
               IF RESULT-POINTER > 1
                   STRING ','
                       INTO WS-RESULT-LIST WITH POINTER RESULT-POINTER
               END-IF
               STRING WS-CANDIDATES(CANDIDATE-IND) DELIMITED BY SPACE
                   INTO WS-RESULT-LIST WITH POINTER RESULT-POINTER
           END-IF
       END-PERFORM
       .
